.TH ferry-pair 1  Ferry "Ferry Manual"
.SH NAME
ferry\-pair \- Pair with a nearby device (name or Node ID from `ferry discover`); the other side confirms and both show the same code
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBferry pair\fR [\fB\-\-auto\-accept\fR] [\fB\-\-lang\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fITARGET\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Pair with a nearby device (name or Node ID from `ferry discover`); the other side confirms and both show the same code
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-auto\-accept\fR
Enable Auto\-Accept for the paired device right away
.TP
\fB\-\-lang\fR \fI<CODE>\fR
Interface language for this run (`en`, `pl`); overrides the saved setting
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fITARGET\fR>
Name or Node ID of a nearby device, or a TICKET / Node ID
